Neighbors,

Two items from the association:

1. Street resurfacing. The city has confirmed resurfacing of Trestle Glen Rd between Lakeshore and Park Blvd next week, Monday March 23 through Friday March 27, roughly 7am to 5pm each day. No parking on the affected blocks during work hours (signs go up Friday); cars left on the street will be towed to the lot on 2nd Ave. Driveway access is maintained except for the two to three hours while your block is being paved; crews will knock.

2. Spring cleanup is Saturday, April 18, 9am at the triangle park. Gloves and bags provided; coffee from the usual suspects.

Minutes from the March meeting are posted on the website. Next meeting: Tuesday, April 7, 7pm at the library branch.

- TGN steering committee
